      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "YouR model have an animator assign so it play the default state in it. For part of model that disappear you have multiple skinned mesh with different bounds box.\n-Remove the animator from the model\n-Merge your skinned mesh in the 3D program of chose or expand each boundary to match your body. Then assign the chest/spine bone as anchor overwrite on each skinned mesh.",
